<title>POLAND: OKOCIM TO BREW CARLSBERG BEER.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM TO BREW CARLSBERG BEER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brewer Okocim SA signed a licencing agreement with its 31.8-percent shareholder Denmark's Carlsberg International under which it would produce Carlsberg beer, Okocim said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Okocim said it would launch the beer in the forthcoming summmer season. It gave no further details and no one in the company was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
